  "description": "There were young men who formed a merchants' association to fight against local thugs and protect their businesses themselves.\n\nBut after constant clashes, they were accused of being gangsters themselves, blocking their future prospects.\nAt that moment, Hyun Tae-cheol, the core of the group, resolved:\n\"Rather than staying here like this, let's go up to Seoul and become true big shots.\"\nAccepting his proposal, Kwon Tae-soo, Kim Min-kyu, and likeminded others joined him as they departed for the great city of Seoul.\nA story of youth struggling desperately to survive in a strange and ruthless world.\n\n— The chronicle of those fierce days.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67915284), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B8%94%EB%9F%AC%EB%93%9C%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B8-%EC%A0%9C%EB%A1%9C/4690)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/188582)",
